// Imported from a modern OSRS cache by tools/models/importosrs.py.
// Models are RE-ENCODED from OSRS model format into the 317-family format
// (tools/models/osrs2ob2.py); every one is round-trip verified before writing.
// wearpos/wearpos2/wearpos3 come from the cache - do not hand-edit them.
//
// God Wars Dungeon general drops. Stats are the OSRS wiki's. Godswords and the Saradomin sword
// use the OSRS 2h-sword animations (osrs_2h_*, skill_combat/configs/melee/osrs_weapon_anims.seq -
// needs the ClientPlayer walk-merge client patch); the Zamorakian spear uses this build's spear
// animations. None of them has a special attack yet.
// Later-OSRS uniques (Steam battlestaff, Staff of the dead, Saradomin's light, Armadyl crossbow)
// are deliberately absent; see bosses/godwars/scripts/gwd_drops.rs2.

